    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Does anyone know the difference in nuance between 依存(いぞん), 依頼(いらい) and 頼る(たよる).\nI think 依頼 involves requesting (maybe to a superior) while 依存 is maybe a little stronger? Usually I hear に頼ってる in casual speech.\n\nBy the way, should the Japanaese title be changed to に依存? The ro-maji and Kanji don't match.",
      "html": "Does anyone know the difference in nuance between 依存(いぞん), 依頼(いらい) and 頼る(たよる).<br/>I think 依頼 involves requesting (maybe to a superior) while 依存 is maybe a little stronger? Usually I hear に頼ってる in casual speech.<br/><br/>By the way, should the Japanaese title be changed to に依存? The ro-maji and Kanji don't match.",
      "credits_raw": "blabby",
      "content_sha256": "20638ff19f7c067f3f25c0018256daa015842e6d112272b515b83f1f3a73736e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "依頼 means \"to request.\"\n依存 means \"to rely upon\"\n頼る means \"to depend on\" or \"count on\"\n依存 is stronger than 頼る",
      "html": "依頼 means \"to request.\"<br/>依存 means \"to rely upon\"<br/>頼る means \"to depend on\" or \"count on\"<br/>依存 is stronger than 頼る",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "8c2dd54b513dcda7d19a780d4261ad3e355f61a2d91c75b9f427cfd0ce024b63",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "私は日本語がさっぱり分からないから御遠慮なくて私の文法を直してください。",
      "html": "私は日本語がさっぱり分からないから御遠慮なくて私の文法を直してください。",
      "credits_raw": "timmy43",
      "content_sha256": "12ae6f414f4665e5847fe0061695e3cb86b7a43f4c9cb9fa01d37f9ef841d5db",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "in the WWWJDIC, there are two pronunciation for 依存: \"いぞん\" or \"いそん\". Why do you have only one in the title of this grammar entry?",
      "html": "in the WWWJDIC, there are two pronunciation for 依存: \"いぞん\" or \"いそん\". Why do you have only one in the title of this grammar entry?",
      "credits_raw": "赤毛",
      "content_sha256": "1b35afccab2ed62cef2fd4194dd63bed9ebac1a840bd1f13bc0b8b3c50eb74d3",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
  ],
